@Question1_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Login to generate JWT Token
POST {{Question1_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Access Secure Endpoint (Without Bearer Token - Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{Question1_HostAddress}}/api/secure/data

### 3. Access Secure Endpoint (With Bearer Token)
# Replace YOUR_JWT_TOKEN with the token returned by the login endpoint above
GET {{Question1_HostAddress}}/api/secure/data
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
